widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Product Ingredients<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d1b5dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9d1b5dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Sparta Shampoo&#8217;s core ingredients include:<\/p>\n<h3>Active Ingredients:<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Caffeine: Stimulates hair follicles and prolongs the hair growth cycle.<\/li>\n<li>Biotin (Vitamin B7): Strengthens keratin and improves hair structure.<\/li>\n<li>Saw Palmetto Extract: Inhibits 5-\u03b1 reductase, reducing the impact of DHT on hair follicles.<\/li>\n<li>Ginger Extract: Promotes scalp blood circulation and stimulates hair follicles.<\/li>\n<li>Rosemary Essential Oil: Anti-inflammatory and antibacterial, improves scalp health.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Supporting Ingredients:<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Amino Acid Surfactants: Gently cleanses without damaging the scalp&#8217;s natural barrier.<\/li>\n<li>Panthenol (Vitamin B5): Moisturizes and improves hair&#8217;s moisture balance.<\/li>\n<li>Natural Plant Extracts: Aloe vera, green tea, etc., provide antioxidant protection.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d94868 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7d94868\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-80f9d4e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"80f9d4e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-135d4a3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"135d4a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=