=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Consumer Feedback<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e2d6179 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e2d6179\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>&#8220;After using Sparta Shampoo for three months, my hair loss has significantly decreased, and I&#8217;ve seen new hair growth at my hairline.&#8221; \u2014 Mr. Zhang, 35 years old<\/li>\n<li>&#8220;I love its refreshing minty feel, and my hair looks fuller. This is the only truly effective anti-hair loss shampoo I&#8217;ve ever used.&#8221; \u2014 Ms. Li, 28 years old<\/li>\n<li>&#8220;Gentle yet effective, my sensitive scalp experienced no irritation, and my hair became stronger.&#8221; \u2014 Mr. Wang, 42 years old<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0712ccb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0712ccb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How to Use<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-755adbb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"755adbb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n<li>Wet hair and scalp with warm water.<\/li>\n<li>Take an appropriate amount of Sparta Shampoo (about the size of a coin) into your palm.<\/li>\n<li>Gently massage the scalp for 3-5 minutes, ensuring the product covers all areas.<\/li>\n<li>Let the shampoo remain on the scalp for 2-3 minutes to allow the active ingredients to be fully absorbed.<\/li>\n<li>Rinse thoroughly with warm water.<\/li>\n<li>Recommended us