nt elementor-element-ffdeac1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ffdeac1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Q1: How long does it take to see results with Sparta Shampoo?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>A: Most users begin to notice reduced hair loss after 4-8 weeks of continuous use. Improved hair density usually takes more than 3 months.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Q2: Can this shampoo be used daily?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>A: It is recommended to use it 3-4 times a week to allow the scalp to rest. Over-cleansing may strip the scalp of its natural oils.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Q3: Can women use Sparta Shampoo?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>A: Yes, it can be used by both men and women. The formula targets hair loss caused by various reasons.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Q4: Do I need to use conditioner after using it?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>A: Sparta shampoo itself contains conditioning ingredients, but if you have dry hair, you can use a silicone-free conditioner, applying it mainly to the ends of your hair, not your scalp.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Q5: Is this product compatible with other hair growth products?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>A: It is recommended to consult a professional to avoid irritation from using multiple strong hair growth products simultaneously.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Q6: Will the shampoo change my hair color?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>A: No, Sparta shampoo does not contain bleaching or dyeing ingredients and will not change your natural or dyed hair color.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Q7: How long does one bottle last?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>A: Depending on usage frequency and hair length, a 250ml bottle typically lasts 4-6 weeks.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>This article provides a comprehensive overview of the ingredients, mechanism of action, scientific basis, usage methods, and actual effects of this innovative product, offering aut